This product includes software derived from NetBird
(https://github.com/netbirdio/netbird), licensed under the BSD 3-Clause
License (see LICENSE.netbird-bsd3 for the full text). The following parts were
adapted from upstream NetBird:

  - internal/tunnel/         WireGuard interface management (per platform)
  - internal/tunnel/dns/     Per-OS DNS configuration (systemd-resolved, scutil,
                             NRPT, NEDNSSettings)
  - mobile/ios/GoatClientSDK/      iOS gomobile facade (NetworkExtension bridge)
  - mobile/android/GoatClientSDK/  Android gomobile facade (VpnService bridge)
  - internal/ui/             Fyne desktop GUI, pattern-derived only (systray
                             parent process + Fyne window child process,
                             cross-platform notifier interface). No source
                             files copied verbatim; no NetBird icon assets.
  - internal/ipc/grpc/       gRPC dialer (ServerName port strip)
  - internal/ipc/            daemon IPC (reshaped; mesh RPCs removed)

Upstream NetBird:         https://github.com/netbirdio/netbird
Upstream commit pinned:   3fc5a8d4a1fe308ff1068764a09b90b0859ab8fe
NetBird fork used:        https://github.com/USAREUR-AF/netbird
                          (branch goat/extra-root-ca: ServerName port strip,
                          and grpc.ExtraRootCAsPEM, which this client sets)

Not carried from upstream:
  - OAuth / SSO / device-flow sign-in (replaced by bundle import)
  - the NetBird management, signal, peer and relay clients in the
    single-peer wg-cp0 mode (the inner mesh uses the fork's embedded client)
  - the embedded SSH server
  - mesh ACL firewall pieces (platform detection kept)

